    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a \"setback\" though. it's a total collapse. i can see the look on my family's faces when they realize i can't even pay the mortgage. i can see the pity in my friends' eyes. i've spent my whole life being the provider, the successful one. now i'm just a joke. if i just keep going through this, i'm just forced to watch myself rot in public. it feels so undignified.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
